From e0d3598421e9aa746cb33564a201565aa37d3b5a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JeyKul <minkajey@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 13:49:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: add Samsung Galaxy Tab S7+ Wi-Fi bring-up

Board file, pogo keyboard driver and charger support. The pin hogs and
extra logging are temporary bring-up aids.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile             |   1 +
 .../dts/qcom/sm8250-samsung-gts7xlwifi.dts    | 304 +++++++++++++++
 drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-qcom-geni.c            |  10 +-
 drivers/input/keyboard/Kconfig                |   8 +
 drivers/input/keyboard/Makefile               |   1 +
 drivers/input/keyboard/samsung-stm32-pogo.c   | 364 ++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/mfd/max77705.c                        |  11 +-
 7 files changed, 695 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250-samsung-gts7xlwifi.dts
 create mode 100644 drivers/input/keyboard/samsung-stm32-pogo.c

